Package: sipvoice
Version: @VERSION@
Section: comm
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: asterisk, asterisk-config, ffmpeg, curl, ca-certificates, sudo, uuid-runtime, libtiff-tools, imagemagick, ghostscript, libsox-fmt-mp3, python3-venv, paps, fonts-noto-cjk
Maintainer: SIPVoice Contributors <sipvoice@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/wuri114514/sipvoice
Description: Lightweight SIP voice AI gateway
 Asterisk plus a single Go binary that turns ordinary phone calls into an
 AI conversation. Ships a web console, provider presets, online model
 listing, end-to-end voice (Qwen-Omni-Realtime) and one-command deployment.
 .
 ALPHA software: written 100% by AI under human direction, not reviewed line
 by line. Do not use it in production or in any life-safety context.
